              "aws_devops.gate_release_completion_on_a_deployed_service_smoke_check#tb3",
              "aws_devops.gate_release_completion_on_a_deployed_service_smoke_check#tb4",
              "aws_devops.gate_release_completion_on_a_deployed_service_smoke_check#tb5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "text": "In the supplied Lambda validation action, call PutJobSuccessResult with the job ID only after a passing check. On failure, call PutJobFailureResult so dependent progression remains blocked. Retain revision, endpoint result and job outcome together.",
